### List angle technical specifications
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification HTTP/1.1

### List with client filter
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification?client=CLIENT_A HTTP/1.1

### Meta (color modes, file formats)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification/meta HTTP/1.1

### Create angle technical specification — happy path
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "E-commerce front 2000x2000",
  "client": "CLIENT_A",
  "dimensions": {
    "width": 2000,
    "height": 2000,
    "dpi": 300
  },
  "background": {
    "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "fileSpecifications": {
    "colorMode": "srgb",
    "fileFormat": "jpg"
  }
}

### Create duplicate spec — returns existing (deduplicated)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate name ok",
  "client": "CLIENT_A",
  "dimensions": {
    "width": 2000,
    "height": 2000,
    "dpi": 300
  },
  "background": {
    "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "fileSpecifications": {
    "colorMode": "srgb",
    "fileFormat": "jpg"
  }
}

### Create — missing client
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid",
  "dimensions": {
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 1000,
    "dpi": 72
  },
  "fileSpecifications": {
    "colorMode": "rgb",
    "fileFormat": "png"
  }
}

### Create — invalid color mode
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid color mode",
  "client": "CLIENT_A",
  "dimensions": {
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 1000,
    "dpi": 72
  },
  "fileSpecifications": {
    "colorMode": "invalid",
    "fileFormat": "png"
  }
}

### Get by id — replace with real id
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification/000000000000000000000000 HTTP/1.1

### Delete by id — replace with real id
DELETE http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-technical-specification/000000000000000000000000 HTTP/1.1
